<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Extra Info.plist keys merged into the macOS bundle by Tauri.

  NSMicrophoneUsageDescription is what macOS shows the first time push-to-talk
  opens the mic. It is not optional: without it the system terminates the app
  the moment getUserMedia asks for audio, rather than showing a prompt. Pairs
  with com.apple.security.device.audio-input in entitlements.plist.

  The three folder descriptions are what macOS shows when 마이 세컨드 브레인 first touches
  Documents (the default vaults root, Documents/mav), Desktop or
  Downloads (only ever a vault folder the user picked there).
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
    <string>말하기 버튼을 누르고 있는 동안에만 마이크를 써서 볼트에 실시간 음성을 보내요. 녹음하거나 저장하지 않아요.</string>
    <key>NSDocumentsFolderUsageDescription</key>
    <string>볼트를 Documents/mav 폴더에 보관해요.</string>
    <key>NSDesktopFolderUsageDescription</key>
    <string>여기서 고른 볼트 폴더만 읽어요.</string>
    <key>NSDownloadsFolderUsageDescription</key>
    <string>여기서 고른 볼트 폴더만 읽어요.</string>
</dict>
</plist>
